  "civic.data.natural_history.inspiration": "Inspiration: Reach level {buildingLevel} in the Museum.",
  "civic.data.natural_history.name": "Natural History",
  "civic.data.our_cradle.description": "Unlocks the “Last Resort” Policy Card (removes {pollutionReductionPerAlienBuildingLevelPerSecond} Pollution per second per alien building level) and the Planetary Climate Regulation Satellite Network Wonder (permanently removes {permanentPollutionReductionPerSecond} Pollution per second).",
