  "civic.data.supreme_directive.description": "Unlocks “Supreme Directive” (reduces launch production time by {launchProductionTimeReductionSeconds}s, replacing “Interstellar Exploration Fever”) and “Energy Conservation” (launch-site Hydrothermal Energy use −{launchHydrothermalConsumptionReductionPercent}%; Merfolk Happiness upkeep +{merfolkHappinessUpkeepIncreasePercent}%).",
