  "civic.data.the_gods_themselves.description": "Unlocks the Black Obelisk building. It costs {constructionCost} Stone Beam to build; cost per level scales by {costMultiplier}×, and each level multiplies global Faith production by {faithProductionMultiplier}×.",
  "civic.data.the_gods_themselves.inspiration": "Prerequisite: Interstellar Politics. Inspiration: Complete more than {prestigeCycleThreshold} Prestige cycles.",
